  "bio": "Troy Radecki is a highly skilled tattoo artist renowned for his work in trashpolka and illustrative styles. Based in Wildwood, United States, Troy is an award-winning tattooist whose professionalism is reflected in his impressive sponsorships from notable industry names like World Famous Ink, Tatty Stick, and Uberderm. His work is showcased at @truinkgallery in North Branford, CT, where clients can expect a blend of artistic mastery and top-tier professionalism.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wildwood, New Jersey, United States\n\nTattooing 2004,proudly on the @worldfamousink ProTeam, sponsored by tatty stick, uberderm.Award winning tattooist. Find me @atsftdrum  & conventions",
